- /redfish/v1/Systems/{ComputerSystemId}/Storage/{StorageControllerId}/StoragePools

- /redfish/v1/Systems/{ComputerSystemId}/Storage/{StorageControllerId}/StoragePools/{storagepool_Id}

- /redfish/v1/Systems/{ComputerSystemId}/Storage/{StorageControllerId}/StoragePools/{storagepool_Id}/AllocatedVolumes

